omx-contract (2.14.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Release 2.14.0
  * hrp: the instrument families and the search each one implies (#85)
  * mbcomp: the multiband compressor's limits, MBC_MIN_BANDS, MBC_MAX_BANDS,
    MBC_CORNER_MAX_FRACTION and the come-up corners by band count (#62)
  * eq: the biquad kinds and the low-pass hand-over table (#86)
  * Declare the 14 kernel travels and constants the console still typed as
    literals (#44)
  * schema: seconds and minutes join the unit list (#44)
  * docs: what semver classifies, and the development-phase rule (#5)
  * delay: the tap factor set as two integer lists, DELAY_TAP_FACTOR_NUMS and
    DELAY_TAP_FACTOR_DENS, and the tap ceiling's integer reader named (#63)
  * hrp: hold HRP_AMOUNT_RANGE's come-up value to what its readers derive
    (#30, #64)
  * geq: the design mode control GEQ_MODES (standard | true) and the
    designClamped readout (#71)
  * delay: the read-tap travel FX_DELAY_TAPS_RANGE and the per-tap gain and
    pan limits DELAY_TAP_LIMITS (#63)
  * docs and schema: describe the shapes the data uses, trim the unit list,
    give four placeholder docs their reason (#5)
  * drive: the curve and band choices declare their come-up, soft and full
    (#46)
  * Refuse AI-attribution lines in commit messages: commit-msg hook and a
    pull request check

 -- Pau Aliagas <linuxnow@gmail.com>  Fri, 16 Oct 2026 23:39:31 +0000
